            "value" : "Colima is running without Rosetta, on a QEMU VM that can’t enable it: the x86_64 image is emulated too slowly there and the wrapper’s engine times out. Recreate the VM (colima delete), then run the assistant again; the image will need to be rebuilt."
          }
